[/color][color=LimeGreen]000000 [/color][color=Magenta]89 50 4E 47 0D 0A 1A 0A 00 00 00 0D 49 48 44 52 00 00 09 1F 00 00 07 3F 08 06 00 00 00 A6 E8 13
